{"product_id":"sleepytime-tales-for-children","title":"Sleepytime Tales for Children","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"220\"\u003eTimeless bedtime stories to spark young imaginations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"514\"\u003e\u003cem data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"253\"\u003eSleepytime Tales for Children\u003c\/em\u003e by Enid Blyton is a charming collection of gentle, heartwarming stories perfect for bedtime. With her signature warmth and imagination, Blyton brings to life magical creatures, talking animals, and everyday adventures that soothe and delight young readers.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"731\"\u003eEach tale is short enough for a night-time read, making this book an ideal addition to any child’s bedtime routine. A classic collection that parents will love reading—and children will love hearing—again and again.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"844\"\u003eAuthor: Enid Blyton\u003cbr data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"759\"\u003eISBN: \u003cbr data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"798\"\u003eFormat: Paperback\u003cbr data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"822\"\u003ePages: Approx. 120\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45621227683993,"sku":"1RG09488378","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/9780753727881.png?v=1754484775","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/sleepytime-tales-for-children","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}